                        <foliation>Foliation is provided by the library and is marked on the right
                           upper edge of the recto folia in blue pen.</foliation>
                        <condition key="other">There are only a few folia left from the original
                           manuscript. The preserved folia have been bound together as a book and
                           are in a good condition. While the text is mostly readable, some pigments
                           on the illuminations have peeled off over time and some <term
                              key="protectiveCurtain">protective curtains</term> have been
                           lost.</condition>
                     </supportDesc>
